   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidrag till Fondens verksamhet i framf&#xF6;rallt  &#xD6;stra och S&#xF6;dra Afrika samt Karibien och  Sydamerika. Fonden st&#xF6;djer sm&#xE5; MR-organisationer  som f&#xF6;rs&#xF6;ker etablera sig. &#xD6;kat fokus p&#xE5; kvinnor and sociala, kulturella och ekonomiska r&#xE4;ttigheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Foundation&apos;s activities in particular in Eastern and South Africa and the Carribean and South America. The Foundation supports small HR organisations which try to  establish themselvs. Increased focus on women and social, cultural and economic rights.</narrative>
